        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.citydirectory.us/village-ursa.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It is part of the Quincy, IL–MO Micropolitan Statistical Area, making Quincy the nearest major urban center for residents.",
